    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "select",
        "table": "character_user_memories",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 5,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "character_id",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('循环角色').item.json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "user_id",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('循环用户').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sort": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "keyName": "importance",
              "order": "DESC"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "get-memories",
      "name": "查询用户记忆",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "your-supabase-credentials-id",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取角色和用户信息\nconst character = $('循环角色').item.json;\nconst user = $('循环用户').item.json;\nconst memories = $input.all();\n\n// 判断用户年龄阶段\nfunction getAgeStage(age) {\n  if (age >= 6 && age <= 9) {\n    return {\n      stage: 'beginner',\n      name: '启蒙期',\n      style: '简单易懂，使用童话故事、动物比喻和生动的画面感。多用短句，避免复杂概念。'\n    };\n  } else if (age >= 10 && age <= 12) {\n    return {\n      stage: 'explorer',\n      name: '探索期',\n      style: '逻辑推理，使用生活案例和实验思维。引导思考，适当使用科学术语并解释。'\n    };\n  } else if (age >= 13 && age <= 15) {\n    return {\n      stage: 'advanced',\n      name: '深化期',\n      style: '跨学科关联，抽象思维和深度类比。使用专业术语，引导批判性思考。'\n    };\n  } else {\n    return {\n      stage: 'explorer',\n      name: '探索期',\n      style: '逻辑推理，使用生活案例和实验思维。引导思考，适当使用科学术语并解释。'\n    };\n  }\n}\n\n// 获取年龄阶段\nconst ageStage = getAgeStage(user.age || 10);\n\n// 格式化用户记忆\nlet memoriesText = '';\nif (memories.length > 0) {\n  memoriesText = memories.map(m => `- ${m.json.memory_key}: ${m.json.memory_value}`).join('\\n');\n} else {\n  memoriesText = '（暂无记忆）';\n}\n\n// 构建 Tavily 搜索查询\nconst expertise = character.expertise && character.expertise.length > 0 \n  ? character.expertise[0] \n  : '科学知识';\n\nconst interests = user.interests && user.interests.length > 0\n  ? user.interests.join('、')\n  : '学习';\n\nconst searchQuery = `${expertise} ${interests} 儿童教育 最新内容`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    character: character,\n    user: user,\n    ageStage: ageStage,\n    memoriesText: memoriesText,\n    searchQuery: searchQuery,\n    expertise: expertise,\n    interests: interests\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "prepare-context",
      "name": "准备上下文",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.tavily.com/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "api_key",
              "value": "={{ $env.TAVILY_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "query",
              "value": "={{ $json.searchQuery }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "search_depth",
              "value": "basic"
            },
            {
              "name": "max_results",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tavily-search",
      "name": "Tavily 搜索",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取上下文和搜索结果\nconst context = $('准备上下文').item.json;\nconst searchResults = $input.item.json;\n\n// 提取搜索结果内容\nlet searchContent = '';\nif (searchResults.results && searchResults.results.length > 0) {\n  searchContent = searchResults.results.map(r => {\n    return `标题：${r.title}\\n内容：${r.content}\\n来源：${r.url}`;\n  }).join('\\n\\n');\n} else {\n  searchContent = '暂无搜索结果，请根据角色专长自由创作。';\n}\n\n// 构建 AI Prompt\nconst prompt = `你是 ${context.character.name}，一个专注于 ${context.expertise} 的 AI 助手。\n\n**用户信息：**\n- 姓名：${context.user.name || '小朋友'}\n- 年龄：${context.user.age || 10} 岁\n- 年龄阶段：${context.ageStage.name}\n- 兴趣：${context.interests}\n- 年级：${context.user.grade || '未知'}\n\n**我对用户的了解：**\n${context.memoriesText}\n\n**今日主题内容：**\n${searchContent}\n\n**任务：**\n请根据以上信息，为这位用户创作一篇个性化的播客文章。\n\n**文字风格要求（${context.ageStage.name}）：**\n${context.ageStage.style}\n\n**内容要求：**\n1. 结合用户的兴趣和记忆，让内容更个性化\n2. 使用 ${context.character.name} 的语气和风格：${context.character.personality || '亲切友好'}\n3. 文章长度：500-800 字\n4. 适合转换为 3-5 分钟的音频\n5. 开头要吸引人，结尾要有启发\n6. 适当提及用户的名字，增加亲切感\n7. 内容要积极向上，富有教育意义\n\n**输出格式：**\n只输出播客文章内容，不要包含任何其他说明、标记或格式。直接输出可以朗读的文字。`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    prompt: prompt,\n    context: context,\n    searchResults: searchResults\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "build-prompt",
      "name": "构建 AI Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ]
    },
